        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sawn timber, paraná pine (SFM), u=15%, BR, at maritime harbour</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sawn timber, paraná pine (SFM), u=15%, BR, at maritime harbour
data refers to wood from Brazil, used in Europe. main ports in Europe include Rotterdam, Hamburg, Bremerhafen or Antwerpen. Currently, there is an export ban in place for Brazilian Paraná pine;
Synonyms: Araucaria angustifolia; 
UUID: 14a5c934-dae3-3765-9d5a-5fa665ab9043
includes transportation of the sawn timber from the sawmill to a main harbour in Europe by truck and freight ship.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: average processes for transportation to Europe; transport distance however can vary
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_14a5c934-dae3-3765-9d5a-5fa665ab9043.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
